        "Speaker": {
          "type": "cexostring",
          "value": ""
        },
        "Text": {
          "type": "cexolocstring",
          "value": {
            "0": "*He takes the star back and weighs it in his palm.* Fifteen levels, and the watch still kept -- I knew the wandering when I saw it. A token carried is a beginning; a Ranger should carry something that answers. Let me have this worked into a bow for you. Shall it be done?"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "__struct_id": 5,
        "Animation": {
          "type": "dword",
          "value": 0
        },
        "AnimLoop": {
          "type": "byte",
          "value": 1
