        },
        "Text": {
          "type": "cexolocstring",
          "value": {
            "0": "*The bow is finished: grey yew, the silver star set into the grip.* There -- the Bow of the Uncrowned. Nothing greater is set upon it yet; the Elendilmir and the riding of the Company are for a far greater day, when the hour comes round. You have walked the first of the uncrowned path. Keep the watch, friend."
          }
        }
      }
